         "considerations": [
            "Ensure that the logging system has sufficient storage capacity to handle potentially large volumes of data over the vehicle's lifetime.",
            "Implement secure access controls to protect sensitive diagnostic data from unauthorized access.",
            "Consider how logged data will be retrieved and analyzed, possibly integrating with a centralized diagnostics platform."
