            "Lane Keeping Assist System",  
            "Steering Angle Sensor",  
            "Acceleration Pedal Sensor"  
         ],  
         "functionality": "The LKA system uses inputs from the steering angle sensor to determine the current direction of the vehicle and from the acceleration pedal sensor to understand the driver's intent. By correlating these data points, the system can autonomously adjust the steering to keep the vehicle within its lane.",
