            "Wheel Speed Sensors"  
         ],  
         "functionality": "The traction control system monitors the rotational speed of each wheel through the wheel speed sensors. If a discrepancy is detected, indicating potential wheel slip, the system intervenes by adjusting engine power or applying brakes to maintain traction.",
         "conditions": "This requirement applies under all driving conditions, including wet, icy, and uneven surfaces."
      }  
   ]  
}

