         "steering_system_and_stability_control":"Both requirements are part of the vehicle's overall safety system. The steering system's operability (Requirement 51) is crucial for driver control, while the stability control system (Requirement 26) enhances safety by adjusting to road conditions. A failure in one component could indirectly affect the other if not properly managed.",
