      "resolution_suggestion": "To mitigate any potential issues arising from these dependencies, it is crucial to ensure robust communication protocols and error-checking mechanisms between the accelerator pedal sensors and throttle control system. Additionally, integrating feedback loops where the Traction Control System can adjust based on real-time data from both wheel speed sensors and throttle inputs could enhance overall vehicle performance and safety."  
   },  
   "conclusion": {    
      "compatibility_status": "The requirements are compatible but interdependent.",    
      "justification": "Both requirements aim to ensure the vehicle's safe operation under different conditions. While they address separate systems, their effective functioning is interconnected through the vehicle's control architecture."  
   }  
}

